<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-in">
    <div class="brand"><div class="brandmark"><span class="p">P</span><span class="l">L</span><span class="c">C</span></div><div class="brandcopy"><b>Personalized Learning Companion</b><span>After-school classes & learning support • Grades 4–12</span></div></div>
    <div class="role-switch" id="roleSwitch">
      <button data-view="younger" class="active">Grades 4–7</button><button data-view="older">Grades 8–12</button><button data-view="parent">Parent</button><button data-view="teacher">Teacher</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="shell">
<section class="hero" id="homeHero">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">✨ AFTER-SCHOOL CLASSES + PERSONALIZED SUPPORT</span>
    <h1><span class="plc"><span style="color:#10a79f">P</span><span style="color:#ff6374">L</span><span style="color:#ffb62d">C</span></span><br>Learn today. Brighter tomorrow.</h1>
    <p>Ask with your voice, get step-by-step homework help, practise reading, watch short lesson explainers, revise for tests and exams, and get support in the subjects you find difficult.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn primary" onclick="switchView('younger')">Start Grades 4–7</button><button class="btn purple" onclick="switchView('older')">Start Grades 8–12</button><button class="btn secondary" onclick="editProfile()">Set learner profile</button><button class="btn secondary" onclick="openVision()">See the PLC vision</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card">
    <h3>Everything a learner needs after school 💛</h3>
    <div class="feature-row">
      <div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">🎙️</span>Ask by voice</div><div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">📖</span>Reading Coach</div><div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">▶️</span>Video lessons</div><div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">📸</span>Homework scan</div><div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">📈</span>Progress</div><div class="feature-pill"><span class="icon">🎓</span>All subjects</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">Parents and teachers can see improvement, strengths, difficult topics, and where extra support is needed.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="younger" class="section active">
<div class="dashboard younger">
  <div class="dash-head"><div><h2>☀️ Grades 4–7 Learner Dashboard</h2><p>Explore • Learn • Build confidence</p></div><span class="chip">⭐ Small steps, big progress</span></div>
  <div class="dash-body">
    <aside class="side"><div class="profile-mini"><div class="avatar">👧🏽</div><div><b id="youngNameSide">Hi, Learner!</b><small id="youngGradeSide">Grade 6</small></div></div><div class="nav" data-nav="younger"><button class="active" data-panel="young-home">🏠 Home</button><button data-panel="young-ask">🎙️ Ask PLC</button><button data-panel="young-reading">📖 Reading Coach</button><button data-panel="young-video">▶️ Video Lessons</button><button data-panel="young-homework">📸 Homework Help</button><button data-panel="young-classes">🎓 After-School</button><button data-panel="young-progress">📈 Progress</button></div></aside>
    <main class="main">
      <div class="mobile-tabs" data-nav="younger"><button class="active" data-panel="young-home">Home</button><button data-panel="young-ask">Ask</button><button data-panel="young-reading">Reading</button><button data-panel="young-video">Video</button><button data-panel="young-homework">Homework</button><button data-panel="young-classes">Classes</button><button data-panel="young-progress">Progress</button></div>
      <div class="panel" id="young-home">
        <div class="welcome"><div><h3 id="youngGreeting">Hi! What would you like to learn today?</h3><p>Choose something below. PLC will explain it in small, friendly steps.</p></div><div class="mascot">🤖✨</div></div>
        <div class="grid grid-4">
          <div class="card action-card"><div><div class="bigicon">🎙️</div><h4>Ask with your voice</h4><p>Speak instead of typing.</p></div><button class="mini-btn" onclick="showPanel('younger','young-ask')">Ask now</button></div>
          <div class="card action-card"><div><div class="bigicon">📖</div><h4>Reading help</h4><p>Read aloud and get pronunciation support.</p></div><button class="mini-btn" onclick="showPanel('younger','young-reading')">Read with PLC</button></div>
          <div class="card action-card"><div><div class="bigicon">▶️</div><h4>Video lessons</h4><p>Short explainers for difficult topics.</p></div><button class="mini-btn" onclick="showPanel('younger','young-video')">Watch lesson</button></div>
          <div class="card action-card"><div><div class="bigicon">✏️</div><h4>Homework help</h4><p>Type or upload a homework photo.</p></div><button class="mini-btn" onclick="showPanel('younger','young-homework')">Get help</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card mt"><h3>Choose a subject</h3><p>PLC supports every subject — especially the ones you find difficult.</p><div class="subject-grid mt" id="youngSubjects"></div></div>
        <div class="grid grid-2 mt"><div class="card"><h3>Keep going 🌱</h3><div class="statline"><span>Weekly progress</span><b id="youngPct">42%</b></div><div class="progressbar"><span id="youngProgressBar" style="width:42%"></span></div><p id="youngActivityText">Complete a lesson, reading activity or quiz to grow your progress.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Today after school 🎓</h3><p><b id="youngClassTopic">Maths: Fractions made easy</b></p><p>15-minute guided class with examples and a quick check-in.</p><button class="btn primary mt" onclick="joinClass('Fractions made easy','🍕')">Join class</button></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel hide" id="young-ask"><h2 class="section-title">🎙️ Ask PLC</h2><p class="section-sub">Type or speak your question. PLC explains step by step.</p><div class="grid grid-2"><div class="card"><label class="tiny muted">Subject</label><select id="youngAskSubject" class="select"></select><textarea id="youngAskInput" class="textarea mt" placeholder="Example: I don't understand fractions. Can you explain them simply?"></textarea><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn coral" onclick="startVoice('youngAskInput')">🎙️ Speak</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="answerQuestion('young')">✨ Explain it</button></div><div id="youngReply" class="reply hide"></div></div><div class="card"><h3>PLC teaches, not just answers 💡</h3><div class="list"><div class="list-item"><span>1️⃣</span><div><b>Understand the question</b><p>What is the learner being asked to do?</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span>2️⃣</span><div><b>Explain in small steps</b><p>Simple language appropriate for the grade.</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span>3️⃣</span><div><b>Give an example</b><p>Make the idea easier to see.</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span>4️⃣</span><div><b>Check understanding</b><p>PLC asks a short follow-up question.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>

      <div class="panel hide" id="young-reading"><h2 class="section-title">📖 Reading Coach</h2><p class="section-sub">Like a patient reading helper: listen, practise, pronounce, improve.</p><div class="grid grid-2"><div class="card"><div class="reading-sentence" id="readingSentence">The <mark>bright</mark> sun makes everything look beautiful.</div><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="speakText(document.getElementById('readingSentence').innerText)">🔊 Listen first</button><button class="btn coral" onclick="startReadingCoach()">🎙️ Read aloud</button></div><div id="readingFeedback" class="feedback">When you are ready, tap “Read aloud” and read the sentence.</div></div><div class="card"><h3>PLC helps while the learner reads</h3><div class="list"><div class="list-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><b>Pronunciation support</b><p>Hear a difficult word again.</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><b>Word-by-word help</b><p>Break tricky words into smaller sounds.</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><b>Positive feedback</b><p>Encourage confidence, not embarrassment.</p></div></div><div class="list-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><b>Comprehension check</b><p>Ask what the sentence means.</p></div></div></div><button class="btn primary mt" onclick="newReadingSentence()">Try another sentence</button></div></div></div>

      <div class="panel hide" id="young-video"><h2 class="section-title">▶️ Video Lessons</h2><p class="section-sub">Short teacher-style explanations for difficult lessons.</p><div class="grid grid-3" id="youngVideoCards"></div></div>

